DM200 third-party firmware notice
=================================

This Debian root filesystem and the DM200 kernel image include third-party
wireless firmware and regulatory data. They are distributed for use with the
Broadcom wireless hardware in the King Jim Pomera DM200.

The files retain their original contents. They are not covered by the Linux
kernel GPL license; their own copyright and redistribution terms continue to
apply. See SOURCES.md for the source URLs and checksums, and
LICENCE.broadcom_bcm43xx for the Broadcom license text.

The wireless-regdb package's ISC copyright notice is installed separately at
/usr/share/doc/wireless-regdb/copyright.
